property: comment <ME:0000011> = Variable: taxon ID (a CORAL Taxon) for the ranks of the file's Lineage column (superkingdom as taxonomic domain, kingdom, phylum, class, order, family, genus, species; a rank absent from the lineage is null) and, as the unranked level, the file's Organism column (the NCBI organism name of the target sequence, often strain-level). 565 probes have lineage NA, 296 no organism, and 81 an organism or lineage fragment left by a comma split or an HTML entity in the file (e.g. '16]', 'Ostreococcus &apos'), stored as null. Probes are the same 105,203 as in zhou_lab_corepilot_2017_geochip5, keyed by microarray probe name
